Source: noqtis
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: rootcoder007 <278967282+rootcoder007@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/rootcoder007/noqtis
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libnoqtis0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: post-quantum signing, KEMs and sealed input records
 noqtis records the exact files a result came from, signs that record with
 post-quantum signatures (ML-DSA, SLH-DSA) and timestamps it, so anyone can
 check later that nothing changed. This package has the shared library.

Package: libnoqtis-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libnoqtis0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: post-quantum signing, KEMs and sealed input records (development)
 noqtis records the exact files a result came from, signs that record with
 post-quantum signatures (ML-DSA, SLH-DSA) and timestamps it, so anyone can
 check later that nothing changed. This package has the header, the
 pkg-config file and the CMake package config.

Package: noqtis
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: libnoqtis0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: post-quantum signing, KEMs and sealed input records (command)
 noqtis records the exact files a result came from, signs that record with
 post-quantum signatures (ML-DSA, SLH-DSA) and timestamps it, so anyone can
 check later that nothing changed. This package has the noqtis command.
